This covers the records, the research narrative and the documentation produced
by this project. It does NOT cover:

  * Material harvested from Open Archives (openarch.nl) and the archives it
    aggregates. That material remains under its own terms and is deliberately
    not redistributed here — research/harvest/ is gitignored, and only the
    manifest of queries is committed, so the corpus is reproducible without
    republishing anyone else's data.

  * Images in data/artifacts/ whose rights belong to the holding institution.
    Each artifact record names its repository; check there before reuse.
